WHAT THIS REPOSITORY ADDS
-------------------------

No file of the upstream project is modified. On top of the unmodified web
build this repository adds:

  mobile/preinit.js     viewport meta tag and touch-layout detection, injected
                        into <head> before first paint
  mobile/mobile.css     touch stylesheet, scoped to html.cc-mobile
  mobile/mobile.js      touch UI (tab bar, resizable split workspace, per-step
                        controls) and the bridge to the native shell
  android/              the Android shell: WebView host, asset loader, file
                        save/open, clipboard, back-button handling
  scripts/              packaging, testing, screenshot and build tooling
  docs/                 user guide and release process

These additions, and the packaging that combines them with the upstream build,
are Copyright 2026 the authors of this repository and are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The third-party licence notices of every library bundled into the web build
are carried inside the application assets as the upstream build emits them
(*.LICENSE.txt), and are included in the distributed APK unaltered.
